# #1171: a module whose function takes the GENERIC call path (it binds a
# local, so it is not a frameless leaf accessor). load_file frees the module's
# creator chunk after the body runs, so the function is the ONLY holder of
# its chunk: a call that drops its callee before the new frame holds the
# chunk runs freed code. Loaded by tests/rebind_call_race.eigs and
# tests/rebind_call_self.eigs.
define lm_gen_fn(x) as:
    local y is x * 2
    return y
# The module's value is this number, not the function. A module ending in a
# `define` makes load_file RETURN the shared function, and the caller's
# borrow-protocol check then reads its refcount without an atomic: a separate
# formal race, not the call/rebind path these files pin.
lm_gen_loaded is 1
